all cracks, fractured plates, and open mechanical gaps. The chassis is a masterclass in gritty realism, constructed from highly distinguishable scrap: destroyed machine parts, and crushed automobile components, rusted heavily dented car doors, tires and twisted engine blocks form a broad, distinct Korean-style mecha silhouette. Every surface is caked in thick, realistic layers of desert dust, engine grime, and blistering oxidation.\n\nThe arm configuration is entirely mechanical and weaponized; both upper arms mount directly forward from the shoulders, bypassing forearms or hands entirely to connect instantly into a singular, colossal energy blaster structure that dominates the front of the mecha.\n\nExtending from the back is a propulsion system consisting of two single, straight, narrow metal beams. Each beam acts as a standalone thruster, projecting a massive, powerful down-thrust of white-blue energy that expands outward to form the actual, glowing \"wing-like\" shape. Intense, high-contrast studio lighting catches the granular texture of the rust and dirt, while casting sharp reflections off the exposed metallic edges. Sharp focus, deep depth of field, 8k resolution, photorealism style."],"color":"#232","bgcolor":"#353"},{"id":28,"type":"YARS","pos":[480,840],"size":[280,180],"flags":{},"order":16,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"base_resolution","name":"base_resolution","type":"INT","widget":{"name":"base_resolution"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"aspect_ratio","name":"aspect_ratio","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"aspect_ratio"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"overextend","name":"overextend","type":"BOOLEAN","widget":{"name":"overextend"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"width","name":"width","type":"INT","links":[44,171]},{"localized_name":"height","name":"height","type":"INT","links":[45,172]}],"title":"Resolution Selector","properties":{"aux_id":"Tropfchen/ComfyUI-yaResolutionSelector","ver":"1.2.0","Node name for S&R":"YARS","cnr_id":"co